## ▶️ Installation and Execution

### Install dependencies

```bash
pip install openai langchain langchain-openai faiss-cpu
```

Install any additional packages required by your implementation.

### Configure the API key

Set your OpenAI API key as an environment variable. Do not hardcode or upload API keys to GitHub.

### Run the project

```bash
python main.py
```

The program should print the RAG and non-RAG answers side by side for all five test queries.

