## ✅ Conclusion

This project demonstrates how a RAG pipeline combines semantic search with language generation to provide answers based on a custom knowledge base.

By comparing responses with and without retrieval, the project explores how relevant context can improve answer grounding while highlighting the importance of retrieval quality and careful prompt design.

RAG can reduce hallucinations, but it does not eliminate them entirely.
